L000753	
L000754	Since the chosen update rule explicitly breaks particle-hole symmetry and it is established that correlations in the discrete-time systems may behave drastically different from their continuous-time counterparts~\cite{Wald2025} we wish to establish the nature of the transitions in the discrete-time TASEP.
